    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "AI email assistant workflow:\nObjective:\nAutomatically process incoming emails, draft responses using AI, and route them for human approval via Telegram before sending.\n\nHow it Works:\n Ingest: Triggers on new Gmail messages.  \n\n AI Processing: Groq LLM summarizes content and drafts a response.   \n\nDecision Filter: Evaluates whether a reply is required. \n\n Human Approval: Creates a Gmail draft and alerts you on Telegram for approval.   \n\nAction: Sends the draft upon approval or cancels if rejected.",
